{"id":"dennoch","lemma":"dennoch","pos":"adv","rank":1377,"glosses":["anyhow, however"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-dennoch.ogg/De-dennoch.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe es dennoch versucht.","en":"I tried it anyway.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"}]},{"text":"Hoffen wir, dass es dennoch klappt.","en":"Let's hope it still works.","words":[{"g":"to hope"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to clap","l":"klappen"}]},{"text":"Meine Frau hat ihre Fehler. Dennoch liebe ich sie.","en":"My wife has faults. None the less, I love her.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"},null,{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"she / they / you"}]},{"text":"Ich war müde, aber dennoch konnte ich nicht schlafen.","en":"I was very tired, but I was nevertheless unable to sleep.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"tired"},{"g":"but"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to sleep"}]},{"text":"Unser Haus ist schön, aber ich vermisse das alte dennoch.","en":"Our house is nice, but I still miss the old one.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"well, beautifully"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to miss","l":"vermissen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},null]}]}